1. GAME CONCEPT
ECLIPSE is an original 2D dark fantasy action Metroidvania inspired by the design philosophies of:
Hollow Knight: exploration, precise platforming, atmosphere and boss design.
Dead Cells: responsive movement, fast combat, fluid dodging and satisfying game feel.
Skul: The Hero Slayer: different character forms, abilities and combat identities.
Do not copy characters, artwork, maps, assets or proprietary content from these games.
Create an original identity.
